This laboratory exercise involves MapReduce processing using the White House Visitor Log.
The dataset is located at: /user/adampap/WHV
Please, use a subset of the dataset for testing purposes: /user/adampap/WHVsmall

Remark: you do not need to do data cleaning, e.g. to uppercase names or process different data formats.

